  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Mini Blue Heaven has the most development among the miniature nine heavens. It holds a lot of cloud soil with star path resources such as an arrow bamboo forest, a star fragment grass field, a meteorite pit, and a huge floating star fragment island from Ye Lui Qun Xing’s blessed land, managed by the star core land spirit. A falling star hound infant also lives there.",
      "chapters": [
        1461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_qun_xing_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Star Collection City stands in Mini Blue Heaven. Fang Yuan arranges it as the main city of the sovereign immortal aperture and orders Combat Beast King to oversee overall internal affairs there.",
      "chapters": [
        2127
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capital-city-designation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_star_collection_city",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_combat_beast_king"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A grand city sits on a continent above cloud soil in Mini Blue Heaven. In the heart of that city is a mountain-like hall made from a star snail, where Combat Beast King stations as Star Collection City Lord and oversees the aperture’s internal affairs.",
